@startuml GuestFilteringSubjects
' --- DIAGRAM METADATA ---
title "Sequence Diagram: Guest Filters Subjects on Home Page"

' --- PARTICIPANTS ---
actor Guest
participant "Frontend (Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "Backend (FastAPI)" as Backend

' --- INITIAL STATE ---
ref over Guest, Frontend, Backend : Guest is on the Home Page (from 01_guest_landing)

' --- FLOW OF EVENTS ---
Guest -> Frontend: Clicks subject year filter, selects a year
activate Frontend

alt User selects a specific year (e.g., "L2")
    Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/subjects?year=2
    activate Backend
    
    Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK [Filtered list of subjects]
    deactivate Backend

else User selects "All Years"
    Frontend -> Frontend: Uses cached subject data from initial page load
    note right of Frontend: No new API call is made.
end

Frontend --> Guest: Updates the "Subjects" section with the new list
deactivate Frontend

@enduml